    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, Watch The Artwork</strong> is a casual yet suspenseful experience where you spot changes in living paintings during your night shift at the MaMA - the Museum of Animated Modern Art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/d74dbcbc204bc31cd16dbf4f96a6f86b.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/d74dbcbc204bc31cd16dbf4f96a6f86b.webp?t=1755196964\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=35 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>REPORT ANY CHANGES</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casually flip through surveillance camera\u2019s and report any changes by clicking them and specifying the kind of change. Use the zoom function to delve into every intricate detail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>THE PAINTINGS ARE ALIVE</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/f00c8807bdb852e2bb1356c64929d175.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/f00c8807bdb852e2bb1356c64929d175.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/f00c8807bdb852e2bb1356c64929d175.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren\u2019t your ordinary artworks. They depict animated slices of everyday life. Moments that loop endlessly inside the frame. An American diner at midnight. A woman lost in thought.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>CLOWNS?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/0d97635104b6418e53956fd13643a2f0.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/0d97635104b6418e53956fd13643a2f0.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/0d97635104b6418e53956fd13643a2f0.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sad clown is roaming from canvas to canvas, and his sadness is starting to infect the other paintings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>SIX THEMED GALLERIES</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/ba46736ee97073e65b936021b6ed567a.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/ba46736ee97073e65b936021b6ed567a.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/ba46736ee97073e65b936021b6ed567a.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six levels with six to seven paintings per level bundled by theme and subject. Showcasing more than 40 paintings in total, from American realism painter Edward Hopper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>NO JUMPSCARES, NO MONSTERS</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/2249f09886052304f20e2d70efb64c81.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/2249f09886052304f20e2d70efb64c81.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/2249f09886052304f20e2d70efb64c81.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just you, the night\u2026 and the paintings.<br>Oh\u2026 and of course there\u2019s the clown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caution:</strong> the game can make you feel paranoid, melancholic and isolated.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>ATMOSPHERIC SOUNDSCAPES</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/226df1fc150f3e2f2a92acdf678f648c.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/226df1fc150f3e2f2a92acdf678f648c.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/226df1fc150f3e2f2a92acdf678f648c.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no music, only the ambient sounds of the scenes depicted in the artworks. Ranging from relaxing rain to character voices and New York city soundscapes. However, sounds can also be anomalies, so you\u2019ll have to listen carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>THREE DIFFICULTY LEVELS + COZY MODE</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/060b40dcaab8a8e230ffc1ff3a830c64.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/060b40dcaab8a8e230ffc1ff3a830c64.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/060b40dcaab8a8e230ffc1ff3a830c64.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can get quiet difficult at times because changes can be very subtle. But no worries, there are 3 difficulty modes for each kind of player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is even a <strong>cozy mode</strong> without time pressure and no game over.  <br>Just report changes at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>LOCALIZED IN 15 LANGUAGES</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be available to play in many languages (more might follow):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Nederlands, Fran\u00e7ais, Espa\u00f1ol, Espa\u00f1ol (Latin Americano), Portugu\u00eas, Portugu\u00eas (Brasil), Italiano, Deutsch, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587, \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>INSPIRED BY</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera surveillance games such as \u201cFive Nights at Freddies\u201d and \u201cI\u2019m on Observation Duty\u201d. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The works of American realism painter Edward Hopper, who is known for his themes of loneliness and urban isolation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Museum Of Modern Art in New York</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All artworks have been modified and reinterpreted to create an original interactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/176011464a20d28556454df2ddf87287.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/176011464a20d28556454df2ddf87287.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, Watch The Artwork</strong> is a casual yet suspenseful experience where you spot changes in living paintings during your night shift at the MaMA - the Museum of Animated Modern Art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/d74dbcbc204bc31cd16dbf4f96a6f86b.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/d74dbcbc204bc31cd16dbf4f96a6f86b.webp?t=1755196964\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=35 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>REPORT ANY CHANGES</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.webm?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/8bd88d952246b5de303bac52345833a1.mp4?t=1755196964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casually flip through surveillance camera\u2019s and report any changes by clicking them and specifying the kind of change. Use the zoom function to delve into every intricate detail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>THE PAINTINGS ARE ALIVE</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542500/extras/f00c8807bdb852e2bb1356c64929d175.poster.avif?t=1755196964\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https:/